LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022 - Update 1)
# ==============================================================================
# Passo 1.2: Verificacao NVE a 300 K (dt = 1.0 fs vs 0.5 fs)
# Verifica drift relativo < 1e-4, H <= 0.05 (Eq. 30.8) e convergencia O(dt^2)
# ==============================================================================
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

lattice         fcc 3.614925
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.614925 3.614925 3.614925
region          box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.68955 21.68955 21.68955)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 864 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.68955 21.68955 21.68955)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.003 seconds
mass            1 63.546

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

# 1. Equilibracao curta em NPT a 300 K (10 ps) para preparar o estado inicial
timestep        0.001
velocity        all create 600.0 492845 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

thermo          2000
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press lx

fix             eq all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 0.0 0.0 1.0
run             10000
Neighbor list info ...
  update every 1 steps, delay 0 steps, check yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 7.50679
  ghost atom cutoff = 7.50679
  binsize = 3.753395, bins = 6 6 6
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair eam/alloy, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/atomonly/newton
      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
